      "unresolved": [
        "Natural scheduling into the typed origin 10192 is not established: the town map names 09M.MES at MACHI.MES:57907 in a record the typed decode misframes.",
        "What sets global_u8[150] and global_u8[2516] is not established.",
        "The callee's question at 9634 is supplied explicitly.",
        "Answer 1's EVENTL10.MES door at 9867 sits behind a 12-conjunct summer guard at 9774 (6/16..9/15, 20:59..22:01, the L word above 35, global_u8[399] set, seven flags clear) that the caller's 12/24 guard can never satisfy and is not measured.",
        "Answer 2 with global_u8[532] set replays the question from 9510 to the segment cap and is not declared.",
        "The callee sets its own gate global_u8[2517] at 9484 before asking, sets global_u8[372] -- the prerequisite 44C's I24 and L25 read -- on the 44C door with the stamp banked_u16[242] = 0, and global_u8[286] with the stamp 44 on the MACHI door.",
        "A 16-entry copy at 6669 fills banked_u16[5..16] from [168..].",
        "The clock state_u16[19] is recomputed mid-run by DEF_MAIN.MES definition 11 from state_u16[1] * 100 + state_u16[0], so the second clock ladder at 7666 does not follow the seeded clock.",
        "state_u16[8] is rewritten at 518 before it is read and global_u8[4000] reads 0 at the callee's entry whatever is seeded.",
        "M_PIC.MES native presentation and 44C.MES / MACHI.MES past the doors are not measured."
      ]
